  "tail_interpretation": "The maximum occurs 144.252 seconds into the second observation, not startup. M01 and M02 show simultaneous delivery/worker-delay spikes and recover at the next sample about 0.51 seconds later. Preview ages then fall to 14.17/13.66 ms, relative backlog to 4.69/4.50 ms. This is compatible with a transient scheduling or delivery stall, not a growing queue; the transcript does not establish its exact cause or bound its sub-sample duration. The nine samples above 50 ms and one above 100 ms are retained, with no claim of a hard 50 ms limit.",
